# 🥐 Bakery Sales Analysis

## 📌 Project Overview
This project is part of a Data Analytics Mini Course by RevoU.  
The objective is to analyze bakery sales data to uncover insights related to sales performance, product trends, and customer behavior.

---

## 🎯 Objectives
- Analyze sales trends over time  
- Identify top-performing products  
- Discover peak transaction hours  
- Generate business insights for decision making  

---

## 🛠 Tools Used
- Microsoft Excel  
  - Data Cleaning  
  - Pivot Tables  
  - Data Visualization  

---

## 📊 Key Insights
- Certain products contribute the majority of total revenue  
- Peak transaction times occur during specific hours of the day  
- Sales trends show patterns that can support inventory planning  

---

## 💡 Business Recommendations
- Optimize stock for top-selling products  
- Adjust staffing during peak hours  
- Create promotions based on sales trends  

---

## 📁 Dataset
Dataset provided as part of RevoU Mini Course  

